# Mini CBT Flask Project

Name: Usman Sadiqu shuaibu  
Course: CSC202  
Assignment: Flask Web Application  

## Project Description
This project implements a simple Computer Based Test (CBT) system using Python Flask.  
It demonstrates the use of Object-Oriented Programming, data structures, and Python standard libraries.

## Features
- Question class implemented using OOP
- Web interface using Flask
- Score calculation after test submission
- Timestamp using Python datetime module

